menu "12vhpwr-proto bring-up"

    config CEC_PROTO_RAW_CONSOLE
        bool "v0 raw console loop (simulation-verified bring-up path)"
        default y
        help
            Run the v0 raw printf loop (poll DRDY, pull a frame, print
            codes + volts at ~5 Hz) instead of the TelePlot streaming
            loop. Default ON until bring-up step 3 passes on hardware,
            so the first hardware session uses the exact path verified
            in simulation. The TelePlot path and the CLI 'frame' command
            compile in either mode.

endmenu
